{"3676840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dino-Ducks Mayhem", "steam_appid": 3676840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/0294f471c5dc05cdad03ab0ecf9b58f3.webp?t=1782834461\" width=780 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dino-Ducks Mayhem</strong> is a twin-stick shooter with bullet heaven vibes, wrapped around duck-builder system, set in a duck-tastic world and all about surviving as long as you can while everything explodes around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/da99a620efea1d6debba115d128ec741.poster.avif?t=1782834461\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/da99a620efea1d6debba115d128ec741.webm?t=1782834461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/da99a620efea1d6debba115d128ec741.mp4?t=1782834461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/c11f05464211fadec72fe1e08a294a20.avif?t=1782834461\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras_big/c11f05464211fadec72fe1e08a294a20.webp?t=1782834461 width=1560 height=91 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build out your flock, up to 4 ducklings and save more ducklings during runs to get more choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/7305b91a5c6e23617f701fe8757de900.poster.avif?t=1782834461\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/7305b91a5c6e23617f701fe8757de900.webm?t=1782834461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/7305b91a5c6e23617f701fe8757de900.mp4?t=1782834461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/796aea5c82298d3d6c5400745ddabfbc.webp?t=1782834461\" width=780 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing as the main Dino-Duck is a blast! it's a twin-stick shooter, so you'll use those controls for the core combat. Meanwhile, your adorable ducklings are busy gathering resources and helping take down nearby baddies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/4a1c98ca6925fae057a6b29c4b568d6a.poster.avif?t=1782834461\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/4a1c98ca6925fae057a6b29c4b568d6a.webm?t=1782834461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/4a1c98ca6925fae057a6b29c4b568d6a.mp4?t=1782834461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/39054c42925773fb2634984b1a855971.webp?t=1782834461\" width=780 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear a wave, and boom! You'll snag experience to level up your stats and grab some sweet new gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/52119e6145b4cd38adf3fde69ead52aa.poster.avif?t=1782834461\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/52119e6145b4cd38adf3fde69ead52aa.webm?t=1782834461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/52119e6145b4cd38adf3fde69ead52aa.mp4?t=1782834461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/d6004af76ea124308e56e8d77171be19.webp?t=1782834461\" width=780 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge unique and powerful weapons. Update them for better stats with shards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/d9a1f9e65358066e53cc80b389bbd8fe.poster.avif?t=1782834461\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/d9a1f9e65358066e53cc80b389bbd8fe.webm?t=1782834461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/d9a1f9e65358066e53cc80b389bbd8fe.mp4?t=1782834461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/0294f471c5dc05cdad03ab0ecf9b58f3.webp?t=1782834461\" width=780 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dino-Ducks Mayhem</strong> is a twin-stick shooter with bullet heaven vibes, wrapped around duck-builder system, set in a duck-tastic world and all about surviving as long as you can while everything explodes around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/da99a620efea1d6debba115d128ec741.poster.avif?t=1782834461\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/da99a620efea1d6debba115d128ec741.webm?t=1782834461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/da99a620efea1d6debba115d128ec741.mp4?t=1782834461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/c11f05464211fadec72fe1e08a294a20.avif?t=1782834461\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras_big/c11f05464211fadec72fe1e08a294a20.webp?t=1782834461 width=1560 height=91 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build out your flock, up to 4 ducklings and save more ducklings during runs to get more choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps